Lab 10: Importing Installation Media into Storage Domains
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Import ISO installation images to a Red Hat Virtualization (RHV) storage domain
Attach installation media to virtual machines for operating system provisioning
Verify media accessibility from Red Hat Virtualization Host (RHVH) systems
Understand the relationship between storage domains and installation media
Configure and manage ISO domains for VM deployment workflows
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, students should have:

Basic understanding of virtualization concepts
Familiarity with Red Hat Virtualization Manager interface
Knowledge of storage domain types and configurations
Understanding of ISO image files and their purpose
Access to Red Hat Virtualization environment
Basic Linux command-line skills
